Z||000000||Jncomutt||10-14-2001||01:24 AM||||I'm curious if the stock GT acted in any sense like resonators.  I'm looking to switch my 4cyl into duel exhaust to fit the GT style rear fascia and want to take Steve5s setup and put it to use.(no muffler, just GT tips)<P>Thanks for any info on the tips.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Standard||10-14-2001||02:20 AM||||The stock GT tips are megaphones.  They tend to give it a more "throaty" sound.  I love it!  Haven't heard any 4 bangers with an open exhaust, but MintGreen GT ( <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) up here has a 3.l v6 with a set of monza resonated tips (no cat or muffler).  Sounds damn sweet.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">         <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jncomutt||10-14-2001||04:47 PM||||Thanks..  Thats what I was wondering.  I'll have to look into those monzas<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Standard||10-14-2001||07:55 PM||||actually they're made by Pacesetter.  You can get them from jc whitney for ~27 bucks each, for a dual outlet, 2 1/4" inlet, 2 1/2" tip diameter.<P> <IMG SRC="http://a235.g.akamai.net/f/235/2654/30d/www.jcwhitney.com/images/imagecache/I6095.gif">  <A HREF="http://www.jcwhitney.com/product.jhtml?CATID=14713&BQ=jcw2" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jcwhitney.com/product.jhtml?CATID=14713&BQ=jcw2</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||jelly2m8||10-14-2001||11:04 PM||||I have the Pace setter Monzas on my V8, heres a few pics, they are the 3" outlets, 14" long ones. go with the 11" ones if you want them to stay under the rear fascia, the 14's" stick out, which I kinda like.<P> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/tips%201a.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/tips%20close.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/tips3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/tips4.jpg"> ||||reg||1
